Stores,

The May bearing change on P-201A (WO-3064) used our last 6309-C3 bearing
set. Both lean solvent pumps P-201A and P-201B are due gland repacks in
the August window, and we have one packing set (style 2840, 12 mm) left
against two needed.

Please reorder before end of July:
- 6309-C3 bearing sets x2
- Packing style 2840, 12 mm x2 boxes
- Gland followers x1 (spare, after the corrosion seen on the old one)

If lead time is over three weeks, flag it - the changeover SOP (SOP-U200-07)
depends on a healthy standby, and we saw in November (WO-3039) what
happens when a changeover goes wrong with no margin.

Deepak
